 Manager --> Summarizer
 Manager --> Situation
 Summarizer --> SummaryModel
 Manager --> DatabaseClient : persistence call
@enduml

@startuml EvidenceSequence
 title Evidence Module - Sequence Diagram
 participant SituationManager
 participant EvidenceManager
 participant EvidenceRanker
 participant PrivacyManager
 participant DatabaseClient
 participant Evidence

 SituationManager -> EvidenceManager : request evidence for situation
 EvidenceManager -> EvidenceRanker : select representative posts
 EvidenceRanker --> EvidenceManager : selected posts
 EvidenceManager -> PrivacyManager : mask text and metadata
 PrivacyManager --> EvidenceManager : protected data
 EvidenceManager -> Evidence : create evidence records
 EvidenceManager -> DatabaseClient : store evidence
 DatabaseClient --> EvidenceManager : stored evidence IDs
 EvidenceManager --> SituationManager : evidence list
@enduml

